# Talent tree — single source of truth for the server's talent table.
# Fields are whitespace-separated; name and description must be quoted with "...".
# Tags and requires must not contain spaces.
#
# id               : must match a name in kIdNames (src/systems/talents.cpp) — add both together
# name              : display name shown in the talent UI
# tier              : row in the talent tree (0 = starting talents)
# tags              : comma-separated, no spaces (e.g. magic,fire) — used by sum(group,N); "-" for none
# requires          : "-" for none, or an expression of:
#                       Id            — has that talent
#                       A&B           — both A and B
#                       A|B           — either A or B
#                       (A|B)&C       — parentheses for grouping
#                       sum(group,N)  — at least N learned talents tagged with group
# description       : shown as tooltip text in the talent UI
#
# id               name                tier  tags               requires                                        description
ArcaneKnowledge   "Arcane Knowledge"    0     magic,arcane       -                                               "Foundational arcane study. Required by most arcane talents."
FireKnowledge     "Fire Knowledge"      0     magic,fire         -                                               "Foundational fire study. Required by most fire talents."
FrostKnowledge    "Frost Knowledge"     0     magic,frost        -                                               "Foundational frost study. Required by most frost talents."
BasicTraining     "Basic Training"      0     weapon             -                                               "Improves basic weapon proficiency."
Flames            "Flames"              1     magic,fire         FireKnowledge                                   "Ignites nearby enemies periodically."
FireBolt          "FireBolt"            1     magic,fire,arcane  ArcaneKnowledge&FireKnowledge                   "Launches a bolt of fire at the target."
ArcaneBurst       "Arcane Burst"        2     magic,arcane       (FireKnowledge|FrostKnowledge)&ArcaneKnowledge  "Releases a burst of raw arcane energy."
